# <type>(<scope>): <subject>  ← 50 字符内，动词现在时
#
# <body>  ← 72 字符/行，解释 WHY 不是 WHAT
#
# <footer>  ← 关联 issue / breaking change
#
# === Type 选一个 ===
# feat:     新功能（用户能感知）
# fix:      bug 修复
# refactor: 代码重构（既不加功能也不修 bug）
# perf:     性能优化
# test:     加测试
# docs:     只改文档/README
# style:    格式调整（不影响代码逻辑）
# chore:    杂项（依赖更新、build 配置等）
# lint:     只改 linter 配置/规则
# frontend: 前端（components/ pages/）
# backend:  后端（API routes/ lib/）
# fullstack: 跨前后端
#
# === Scope 选一个（可省略）===
# studio | landing | api | webhook | email
# stripe | supabase | replicate | zip | config
# deps | docs
#
# === 示例 ===
# feat(studio): show 6 free preview portraits instead of 3
# fix(webhook): use public_url not original_image_url
# fullstack(email): switch from hello@ to noreply@petale.love
# refactor(backend): extract generateFullPackAndEmail to lib/petale-order
# chore(deps): add archiver for ZIP packaging
# lint: fix tsc errors in zip-pack.ts
#
# === Breaking Change（如果有）===
# BREAKING CHANGE: <描述>
#
# === References ===
# Refs: #123
# Closes: #456